@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Dashboard

actor User
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as Frontend
participant "ExpenseController" as ExpenseCtrl
participant "BudgetController" as BudgetCtrl
participant "ExpenseService" as ExpenseService
participant "BudgetService" as BudgetService
participant "ExpenseRepository" as ExpenseRepo
participant "BudgetRepository" as BudgetRepo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> Frontend: Відкриває Dashboard
activate Frontend

Frontend -> ExpenseCtrl: GET /api/expenses/user/{userId}
activate ExpenseCtrl
ExpenseCtrl -> ExpenseService: getAllExpensesByUserId(userId)
activate ExpenseService
ExpenseService -> ExpenseRepo: findByUserIdOrderByDateDesc(userId)
activate ExpenseRepo
ExpenseRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM expenses\nWHERE user_id = ?\nORDER BY date DESC
DB --> ExpenseRepo: List<Expense>
ExpenseRepo --> ExpenseService: List<Expense>
deactivate ExpenseRepo
ExpenseService -> ExpenseService: Конвертує в List<ExpenseDTO>
ExpenseService --> ExpenseCtrl: List<ExpenseDTO>
deactivate ExpenseService
ExpenseCtrl --> Frontend: HTTP 200 OK\nList<ExpenseDTO>
deactivate ExpenseCtrl

Frontend -> BudgetCtrl: GET /api/budgets/user/{userId}/active
activate BudgetCtrl
BudgetCtrl -> BudgetService: getActiveBudgetsByUserId(userId)
activate BudgetService
BudgetService -> BudgetRepo: findActiveBudgetsByUserIdAndDate(userId, today)
activate BudgetRepo
BudgetRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM budgets\nWHERE user_id = ?\nAND start_date <= ?\nAND end_date >= ?
DB --> BudgetRepo: List<Budget>
BudgetRepo --> BudgetService: List<Budget>
deactivate BudgetRepo

loop Для кожного бюджету
  BudgetService -> ExpenseRepo: getTotalExpensesByUserIdAndDateRange(userId, startDate, endDate)
  activate ExpenseRepo
  ExpenseRepo -> DB: SELECT SUM(amount)\nFROM expenses\nWHERE user_id = ?\nAND date BETWEEN ? AND ?
  DB --> ExpenseRepo: BigDecimal total
  ExpenseRepo --> BudgetService: BigDecimal spent
  deactivate ExpenseRepo
  BudgetService -> BudgetService: Обчислює spent та remaining
end

BudgetService -> BudgetService: Конвертує в List<BudgetDTO>
BudgetService --> BudgetCtrl: List<BudgetDTO>
deactivate BudgetService
BudgetCtrl --> Frontend: HTTP 200 OK\nList<BudgetDTO>
deactivate BudgetCtrl

Frontend -> Frontend: Обробляє дані\n- Групує витрати за категоріями\n- Підраховує загальні витрати\n- Готує дані для графіків

Frontend -> Frontend: Рендерить компоненти\n- Cards з метриками\n- Pie Chart (категорії)\n- Bar Chart (бюджети)

Frontend -> User: Відображає Dashboard\nз аналітикою
deactivate Frontend

@enduml
